# Origen Metal 1.5.0

- **Released:** 2026-08-19
- **Author:** Stephen McGinty
- **PyPI:** [origen-metal 1.5.0](https://pypi.org/project/origen-metal/1.5.0/)
- **Source:** [`e8986516`](https://github.com/Origen-SDK/o2/commit/e8986516)

Added typed class and list test-program parameters and completed the associated
Origen Metal release updates.

